#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:3
msgid "FAQ"
msgstr "Ofte stillede spørgsmål"

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:6
msgid "How the \"Edit locally\" functionality works"
msgstr "Sådan virker \"Åbn lokalt\""

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:7
msgid ""
"This functionality depends on the desktop client ability to register the "
"nc:// protocol handler. That is the handler used by the server to open a "
"file locally. This will allow the desktop client to open a document with the"
" local editor when you click on the option \"Edit locally\" in your "
"Nextcloud instance."
msgstr ""
"Funktionen kræver, at skrivebordsklienten kan registrere sig som håndtering "
"af protokollen nc://, som serveren bruger til at åbne en fil lokalt. Så kan "
"skrivebordsklienten åbne et dokument i det lokale program, når du klikker på"
" \"Åbn lokalt\" i din Nextcloud."

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:10
msgid ""
"Without properly registering the mime, independent of the browser and distro"
" being used, the desktop client will fail to open a document with the local "
"editor when you click on the option \"Edit locally\" in your Nextcloud "
"instance."
msgstr ""
"Hvis MIME-typen ikke er registreret korrekt, kan skrivebordsklienten ikke "
"åbne et dokument i det lokale program, når du klikker på \"Åbn lokalt\" i "
"din Nextcloud – uanset browser og distribution."

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:12
msgid ""
"The browser will warn you of the failure: \"Failed to launch 'nc://...' "
"because the scheme does not have a registered handler.\""
msgstr ""
"Browseren advarer om fejlen: \"Failed to launch 'nc://...' because the "
"scheme does not have a registered handler.\""

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:15
msgid "How to enable it"
msgstr "Sådan slår du det til"

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:17
msgid ""
"In order to do that, you need to install the desktop client with the MSI "
"installer on Windows or use a third party software to integrate the AppImage"
" in your system on Linux."
msgstr ""
"For at gøre det skal du installere skrivebordsklienten med MSI-"
"installationsprogrammet på Windows eller bruge et program fra tredjepart til"
" at integrere AppImage i dit system på Linux."

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:20
msgid "On Linux"
msgstr "På Linux"

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:22
msgid ""
"We use AppImage due to its universal compatibility but to take full "
"advantage of the desktop client features you will need a third part software"
" to integrate the AppImage in your system: we have tested `AppImageLauncher "
"<https://github.com/TheAssassin/AppImageLauncher>`_ and alternatively there "
"is `Go AppImage <https://github.com/probonopd/go-appimage>`_."
msgstr ""
"Vi bruger AppImage, fordi det virker overalt. Men for at få fuldt udbytte af"
" skrivebordsklientens funktioner skal du bruge et program fra tredjepart til"
" at integrere AppImage i dit system: Vi har testet `AppImageLauncher "
"<https://github.com/TheAssassin/AppImageLauncher>`_, og et alternativ er `Go"
" AppImage <https://github.com/probonopd/go-appimage>`_."

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:25
msgid "On Windows"
msgstr "På Windows"

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:27
msgid ""
"The MSI installer will alter your system registry to register the nc:// "
"protocol handler."
msgstr ""
"MSI-installationsprogrammet ændrer registreringsdatabasen, så klienten "
"registreres til at håndtere protokollen nc://."

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:29
msgid "Alternatively, you can manually register the nc:// protocol handler:"
msgstr "Du kan også selv registrere håndteringen af protokollen nc://:"

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:31
msgid "Save the following content to a .reg file:"
msgstr "Gem følgende indhold i en .reg-fil:"

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:40
msgid "Double click on the .reg file to import it into the registry."
msgstr ""
"Dobbeltklik på .reg-filen for at importere den i registreringsdatabasen."

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:42
msgid ""
"See https://nextcloud.com/blog/nextcloud-office-release-solves-document-"
"compatibility-overhauls-knowledge-management/ for more information."
msgstr ""
"Se https://nextcloud.com/blog/nextcloud-office-release-solves-document-"
"compatibility-overhauls-knowledge-management/ for at få flere oplysninger."

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:45
msgid ""
"Some Files Are Continuously Uploaded to the Server, Even When They Are Not "
"Modified."
msgstr ""
"Nogle filer bliver hele tiden overført til serveren, selvom de ikke er "
"ændret."

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:47
msgid ""
"It is possible that another program is changing the modification date of the"
" file. If the file is uses the ``.eml`` extension, Windows automatically and"
" continually changes all files, unless you remove "
"``\\HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\PropertySystem\\PropertyHandlers``"
" from the windows registry. See "
"http://petersteier.wordpress.com/2011/10/22/windows-indexer-changes-"
"modification-dates-of-eml-files/ for more information."
msgstr ""
"Måske ændrer et andet program filens ændringsdato. Hvis filen har filtypen "
"``.eml``, ændrer Windows automatisk og hele tiden alle filer, medmindre du "
"fjerner "
"``\\HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\PropertySystem\\PropertyHandlers``"
" fra registreringsdatabasen i Windows. Se "
"http://petersteier.wordpress.com/2011/10/22/windows-indexer-changes-"
"modification-dates-of-eml-files/ for at få flere oplysninger."

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:55
msgid "Syncing Stops When Attempting To Sync Deeper Than 100 Sub-directories."
msgstr "Synkroniseringen stopper ved mere end 100 niveauer af undermapper."

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:57
msgid ""
"The sync client has been intentionally limited to sync no deeper than 100 "
"sub-directories. The hard limit exists to guard against bugs with cycles "
"like symbolic link loops. When a deeply nested directory is excluded from "
"synchronization it will be listed with other ignored files and directories "
"in the \"Not synced\" tab of the \"Activity\" pane."
msgstr ""
"Synkroniseringsklienten er med vilje begrænset til højst 100 niveauer af "
"undermapper. Den faste grænse beskytter mod fejl med løkker, f.eks. "
"symbolske links, der peger i ring. Når en dybt indlejret mappe udelukkes fra"
" synkroniseringen, vises den sammen med andre ignorerede filer og mapper "
"under fanen \"Ikke synkroniseret\" i panelet \"Aktivitet\"."

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:65
msgid ""
"There Was A Warning About Changes In Synchronized Folders Not Being Tracked "
"Reliably."
msgstr ""
"Der kom en advarsel om, at ændringer i synkroniserede mapper ikke kan følges"
" pålideligt."

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:67
msgid ""
"On linux when the synchronized folder contains very many subfolders the "
"operating system may not allow for enough inotify watches to monitor the "
"changes in all of them."
msgstr ""
"Hvis den synkroniserede mappe på Linux har rigtig mange undermapper, "
"tillader styresystemet måske ikke nok inotify-overvågninger til at følge "
"ændringerne i dem alle."

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:71
msgid ""
"In this case the client will not be able to immediately start the "
"synchronization process when a file in one of the unmonitored folders "
"changes. Instead, the client will show the warning and manually scan folders"
" for changes in a regular interval (two hours by default)."
msgstr ""
"I så fald kan klienten ikke starte synkroniseringen med det samme, når en "
"fil i en af de ikke-overvågede mapper ændres. I stedet viser klienten "
"advarslen og gennemsøger selv mapperne for ændringer med jævne mellemrum "
"(som standard hver anden time)."

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:76
msgid ""
"This problem can be solved by setting the fs.inotify.max_user_watches sysctl"
" to a higher value. This can usually be done either temporarily::"
msgstr ""
"Problemet kan løses ved at sætte sysctl-værdien fs.inotify.max_user_watches "
"højere. Det kan normalt gøres enten midlertidigt::"

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:81
msgid "or permanently by adjusting ``/etc/sysctl.conf``."
msgstr "eller permanent ved at rette ``/etc/sysctl.conf``."

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:84
msgid "I Want To Move My Local Sync Folder"
msgstr "Jeg vil flytte min lokale synkroniseringsmappe"

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:86
msgid ""
"The Nextcloud desktop client does not provide a way to change the local sync"
" directory. However, it can be done, though it is a bit unorthodox. "
"Specifically, you have to:"
msgstr ""
"Nextclouds skrivebordsklient har ingen funktion til at skifte den lokale "
"synkroniseringsmappe. Det kan dog lade sig gøre, selvom det er lidt "
"utraditionelt. Du skal:"

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:90
msgid "Remove the existing connection which syncs to the wrong directory"
msgstr ""
"Fjerne den eksisterende forbindelse, der synkroniserer til den forkerte "
"mappe"

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:91
msgid "Add a new connection which syncs to the desired directory"
msgstr "Tilføje en ny forbindelse, der synkroniserer til den ønskede mappe"

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:93
msgid "Remove an existing connection"
msgstr "Fjern en eksisterende forbindelse"

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:98
msgid ""
"To do so, click the \"**Account**\" drop-down menu and then click "
"\"Remove\". This will display a \"**Confirm Account Removal**\" dialog "
"window."
msgstr ""
"Det gør du ved at klikke på rullemenuen \"**Konto**\" og derefter på "
"\"Fjern\". Så vises dialogen \"**Bekræft sletning af konto**\"."

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:101
msgid "Remove existing connection confirmation dialog"
msgstr "Dialogen, der bekræfter, at forbindelsen fjernes"

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:106
msgid "If you're sure, click \"**Remove connection**\"."
msgstr "Hvis du er sikker, så klik på \"**Fjern forbindelse**\"."

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:108
msgid ""
"Then, click the Account drop-down menu again, and this time click \"**Add "
"new**\"."
msgstr ""
"Klik derefter på rullemenuen Konto igen, og klik denne gang på \"**Tilføj "
"ny**\"."

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:110
msgid "Replacement connection wizard"
msgstr "Guiden til den nye forbindelse"

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:115
msgid ""
"This opens the Nextcloud Connection Wizard *but* with an extra option. This "
"option provides the ability to either: keep the existing data (synced by the"
" previous connection) or to start a clean sync (erasing the existing data)."
msgstr ""
"Så åbnes Nextclouds forbindelsesguide, *men* med en ekstra mulighed. Her kan"
" du vælge enten at beholde de eksisterende data (som den forrige forbindelse"
" har synkroniseret) eller at starte en ren synkronisering (som sletter de "
"eksisterende data)."

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:120
msgid ""
"Be careful before choosing the \"Start a clean sync\" option. The old sync "
"folder *may* contain a considerable amount of data, ranging into the "
"gigabytes or terabytes. If it does, after the client creates the new "
"connection, it will have to download **all** of that information again. "
"Instead, first move or copy the old local sync folder, containing a copy of "
"the existing files, to the new location. Then, when creating the new "
"connection choose \"*keep existing data*\" instead. The Nextcloud client "
"will check the files in the newly-added sync folder and find that they match"
" what is on the server and not need to download anything."
msgstr ""
"Vær forsigtig, før du vælger \"Start en ren synkronisering\". Den gamle "
"synkroniseringsmappe *kan* indeholde meget data, op til flere gigabyte eller"
" terabyte. Hvis den gør, skal klienten hente **alle** data igen, når den nye"
" forbindelse er oprettet. Flyt eller kopiér i stedet først den gamle lokale "
"synkroniseringsmappe med de eksisterende filer til den nye placering. Vælg "
"derefter \"*behold eksisterende data*\", når du opretter den nye "
"forbindelse. Nextcloud-klienten tjekker så filerne i den nye "
"synkroniseringsmappe, ser, at de passer med dem på serveren, og behøver ikke"
" at hente noget."

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:122
msgid ""
"Make your choice and click \"**Connect...**\". This will then step you "
"through the Connection Wizard, just as you did when you setup the previous "
"sync connection, but giving you the opportunity to choose a new sync "
"directory."
msgstr ""
"Vælg, og klik på \"**Forbind …**\". Så går du igennem forbindelsesguiden, "
"ligesom da du satte den forrige forbindelse op, men nu kan du vælge en ny "
"synkroniseringsmappe."

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:126
msgid "I would like to change the language of the user interface"
msgstr "Jeg vil skifte sprog i brugerfladen"

#: ../../desktop/faq.rst:128
msgid ""
"To do this, the configuration file ``nextcloud.cfg`` must be changed. A line"
" with the desired language must be added to the ``General`` section."
msgstr ""
"Det gør du ved at ændre konfigurationsfilen ``nextcloud.cfg``. Tilføj en "
"linje med det ønskede sprog i afsnittet ``General``."
